    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">内容</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Tomoe:_The_Warrior_Priestess\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">巴：武女神官</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Strategy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">策略</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Vs._Tomoe\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">对决巴</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Overall_Judgement\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">总体评价</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tomoe:_The_Warrior_Priestess\">巴：武女神官</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTomoe_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/00a.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130529040837\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"00a\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/00a.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529040837\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"258\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"00a.jpg\" data-image-key=\"00a.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:00a.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>BP：12</li>\n<li>身高：4</li>\n<li>攻击：1</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Tomoe\" title=\"Tomoe\">巴</a>  ，确实是一位有趣的战士。在战斗中使用她巫女的技能，她能够重击，而且随着战斗的持续，她还能打出更重的伤害！她还有一些诡计，确保如果她得分了，她会得到她想要的页数，而不是你允许的页数。然而反过来，她有一种非常……基本的天性，导致她陷入比她愿意承认的更多的束缚和缠绕，而且她的工具少之又少……\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">策略</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTomoe_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4e/57.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130529043707\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"57\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4e/57.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529043707\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"243\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"57.jpg\" data-image-key=\"57.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:57.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>看看巴的角色卡可能会让许多人困惑地挠头。这没有错，巴‘缺少’7个攻击选项，你可能注意到很多是蓝色的。这反过来使巴成为一个非常‘橙色和红色’的斗士，几乎没有‘低级/蓝色’选项。这就像在格斗游戏中，有人只需要防守就能挡住你几乎所有的攻击。然而，巴有很多有趣的噱头让她进入，并开始惩罚那些轻视她缺乏选项的人。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/86/55.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130529043638\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"55\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/86/55.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529043638\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"245\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"55.jpg\" data-image-key=\"55.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:55.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>首先，巴在使用橙色行动时，有机会获得她的「劈裂头盔」页面，这将使她在剩余比赛中对所有‘眩晕’页面获得+2，如果对手没有头盔，则会自动将伤害导向身体创伤！不仅如此，她的许多攻击会将伤害页面从一处重定向到更痛苦的其他部位（身体创伤变为眩晕，腿部创伤变为身体创伤）！此外，她的‘格挡与打击’攻击，虽然都锁定为红色，但让她能攻击，并且在冲突时，使它们成为一些有效的选择，让她稍微不可预测一点！\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vs._Tomoe\">对决巴</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTomoe_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/41.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130529043241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"41\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"245\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"41.jpg\" data-image-key=\"41.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/41.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529043241\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/41.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130529043241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"41\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/41.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529043241\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"245\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"41.jpg\" data-image-key=\"41.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/41.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529043241\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:41.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>巴最大的弱点在于她的选择非常有限。她只有一个‘假’矩阵选项(格挡与打击：挥击)，再加上她对红色/橙色的重度依赖，这意味着一旦你绊倒她，她就很难恢复。如果你恰好对她造成任何暴击，禁用她的橙色或红色，她几乎当场就注定失败。由于她攻击选项的性质，几击之后她的后续动作就很容易被预测，如果你无法在她身上获得想要的得分，那么这就成了一个简单的猜谜游戏。此外，和这个时代的其他女皇之刃角色一样，巴没有任何治疗能力，所以她起始的体力值就是她所能用的一切，这使得任何失误都相当痛苦。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overall_Judgement\">总体评价</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTomoe_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dc/2P_TOMOE.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130529041029\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P TOMOE\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"259\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"2P TOMOE.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_TOMOE.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dc/2P_TOMOE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529041029\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dc/2P_TOMOE.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130529041029\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P TOMOE\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dc/2P_TOMOE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529041029\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"259\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"2P TOMOE.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_TOMOE.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dc/2P_TOMOE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130529041029\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:2P_TOMOE.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>由于她的攻击布置方式，她的矩阵往往比预期的风险更大，反过来，由于她有限的招式池，她在承受伤害和恢复方面表现不佳。尽管如此，她拥有的东西是有效的。当她能得分时，那一定会很痛，毫无疑问。她只是发展到一定程度，一旦人们开始擅长互相反击，巴缺乏选项对她弊大于利，使她在初学者对战时相当有利(因为能获得高分页面)，但在专业选手对战时更差(因为人们会‘把她像书一样读懂’，嘿嘿)。总体而言，她并不糟糕，她有一个有效的噱头，但她只是被她的小招式池所限制……\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>技能等级：新手</b></li>\n<li><b>等级：C</b></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821132332\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:27209-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821132332 and revision id 63227. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
